WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.410
A garden.

2
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:05.240
A stiff steward with a chain
of office walks the path.

3
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:08.980
Behind a hedge, three
figures try not to laugh.

4
00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:12.830
He dreams aloud: "To be Count Malvolio."

5
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.190
Then he finds a letter,
and starts to smile.

6
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.540
Later, the same man is locked in the dark:

7
00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:23.040
"Sir Topas, never was man thus wronged."

8
00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.760
Tricked, mocked, locked away.

9
00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:28.540
So is this funny, or cruel?

10
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:32.120
In this mission, you'll meet
Malvolio, Olivia's steward,

11
00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:35.200
and see why her household can't stand him.

12
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.960
You'll read the letter scene,
and his dream of rising in rank.

13
00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.940
And you'll step into
the dark room with him.

14
00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:46.690
Your mission: decide whether
Malvolio's treatment is funny or cruel.
